  "constraints": [
    "U1 backed 5V buck is self-enabled and is not software-switchable.",
    "External J8 requires U13 5V_VBUS buck enabled and power good before enabling U36.",
    "Boost disabled does not isolate +24V: VBUS passes through L1 and D1.",
    "SCC_PG is charger input-valid status and does not track CE.",
    "VCAP_EN low can remove ESP32 power when mux IN2 is active.",
    "Expanders retain output state across ESP32-only reset.",
